  "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}(\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061z)=\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061z & \\,\u21d2\\,\\int \\operatorname{cosh}\u2061z\\,\\text{d}z=\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061z+C, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}(\\operatorname{coth}\u2061z)=-{csch}^{2}\u2061z & \\,\u21d2\\,\\int {csch}^{2}\u2061z\\,\\text{d}z=-\\operatorname{coth}\u2061z+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (6\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061z-9{csch}^{2}\u2061z)\\,\\text{d}z & =6\\int \\operatorname{cosh}\u2061z\\,\\text{d}z-9\\int {csch}^{2}\u2061z\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & =6\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061z-9(-\\operatorname{coth}\u2061z)+C \\\\  & =6\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061z+9\\operatorname{coth}\u2061z+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
